WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Which skill should I use? Answer it once and keep the recommendation with the team.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Alex saves a public skill with useful team context.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Sam finds the recommendation in the shared library.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.567
Now see the complete save, share, find, and use workflow.

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:36.617
