00:00:36.617 --> 00:00:38.117
The saved recommendation reaches the team library.

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:40.000
One recommendation becomes shared context from Alex to Sam.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:49.450
Sam searches for copywriting, then copies the example prompt and a compatible install command.

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:54.500
Open the source, copy a compatible command, download a ZIP, or connect through authenticated MCP.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:00.000
Save once. Find fast. Use it your way. Create your team library at skillsboard.sh.
